nd="1:48.100">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">如同解开的腰带上的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hodoketa obi ni yoku nita</span></p><p begin="1:48.480" end="1:52.420" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">淡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.480" end="1:48.840">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.840" end="1:49.780">わ</span></span></span><span begin="1:49.780" end="1:50.120">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">花</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.120" end="1:50.460">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.460" end="1:50.760">な</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">模</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.760" end="1:51.120">も</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">様</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.120" end="1:51.500">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.500" end="1:52.420">う</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">淡淡的花纹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">awai hanamoyō</span></p><p begin="1:53.500" end="1:58.680" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.500" end="1:53.840">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.840" end="1:54.120">と</span></span></span><span begin="1:54.120" end="1:54.780">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.140" end="1:55.520">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.520" end="1:55.840">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:55.840" end="1:56.180">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">唇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:56.180" end="1:56.460">く</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:56.460" end="1:56.862">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:56.862" end="1:57.817">び</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.817" end="1:58.159">る</span></span></span><span begin="1:58.159" end="1:58.680">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">喜爱的你轻声哼唱的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itoshi kimi no kuchibiru ga</span></p><p begin="1:59.160" end="2:03.820" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">口</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:59.160" end="1:59.433">く</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:59.433" end="2:00.340">ち</span></span></span><span begin="2:00.340" end="2:00.760">ず</span><span begin="2:00.760" end="2:01.160">さ</span><span begin="2:01.160" end="2:01.460">む</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:01.460" end="2:01.840">て</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">毬</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:01.840" end="2:02.140">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.140" end="2:03.120">り</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">唄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.120" end="2:03.460">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.460" end="2:03.820">た</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">那首拍球歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kuchizusamu temariuta</span></p><p begin="2:04.140" end="2:09.260" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.140" end="2:04.540">あ</span><span begin="2:04.540" end="2:04.840">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:04.840" end="2:05.820">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="2:05.820" end="2:06.170">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">面</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.170" end="2:06.520">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.520" end="2:06.820">も</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">影</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.820" end="2:07.180">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.180" end="2:07.520">げ</span></span></span><span begin="2:07.520" end="2:08.200">は</span><span begin="2:08.480" end="2:08.800">も</span><span begin="2:08.800" end="2:09.260">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">那一天的容颜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ano hi no omokage wa mō</span></p><p begin="2:09.840" end="2:14.380" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">禍</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.840" end="2:10.200">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.200" end="2:11.160">が</span></span></span><span begin="2:11.160" end="2:11.840">夜</span><span begin="2:11.840" end="2:12.160">最</span><span begin="2:12.160" end="2:12.480">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">果</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.480" end="2:12.840">は</span></span></span><span begin="2:12.840" end="2:14.380">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">早已融入黑夜的尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">magayomo no hate</span></p><p begin="2:14.800" end="2:19.800" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">根</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:14.800" end="2:15.200">ね</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">雪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.200" end="2:15.520">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.520" end="2:15.860">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:15.860" end="2:16.140">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">下</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.140" end="2:16.500">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.500" end="2:16.860">た</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.860" end="2:17.260">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">芽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.460" end="2:17.820">め</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">吹</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.820" end="2:18.160">ぶ</span></span></span><span begin="2:18.160" end="2:18.500">い</span><span begin="2:18.500" end="2:18.800">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.800" end="2:19.120">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.120" end="2:19.520">し</span></span></span><span begin="2:19.520" end="2:19.800">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">积雪之下想要破土而出的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">neyuki no shita de mebuita ishi no</span></p><p begin="2:20.100" end="2:25.160" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">蕾</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.100" end="2:20.500">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.500" end="2:20.820">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.820" end="2:21.160">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:21.160" end="2:21.500">は</span><span begin="2:21.500" end="2:21.820">何</span><span begin="2:21.820" end="2:22.160">処</span><span begin="2:22.160" end="2:22.800">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">咲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.800" end="2:23.160">さ</span></span></span><span begin="2:23.160" end="2:23.520">く</span><span begin="2:23.520" end="2:23.880">の</span><span begin="2:24.120" end="2:24.840">だ</span><span begin="2:24.840" end="2:25.000">ろ</span><span begin="2:25.000" end="2:25.160">う？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">花蕾将在何处绽放呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsubomi wa doko de saku no darō?</span></p><p begin="2:25.440" end="2:30.700" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">差</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.440" end="2:25.820">さ</span></span></span><span begin="2:25.820" end="2:26.180">し</span><span begin="2:26.180" end="2:26.820">の</span><span begin="2:26.820" end="2:27.140">べ</span><span begin="2:27.140" end="2:27.500">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.500" end="2:28.140">て</span></span></span><span begin="2:28.500" end="2:28.840">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">温</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:28.840" end="2:29.080">ぬ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:29.080" end="2:29.520">く</span></span></span><span begin="2:29.520" end="2:29.840">も</span><span begin="2:29.840" end="2:30.160">り</span><span begin="2:30.160" end="2:30.700">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">伸出的手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sashinobeta te no nukumori wa</span></p><p begin="2:31.140" end="2:35.620" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.140" end="2:31.480">か</span></span></span><span begin="2:31.480" end="2:32.520">わ</span><span begin="2:32.520" end="2:33.120">る</span><span begin="2:33.120" end="2:33.460">こ</span><span begin="2:33.460" end="2:33.800">と</span><span begin="2:33.800" end="2:34.200">な</span><span begin="2:34.200" end="2:35.620">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">有着不变的温暖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kawaru koto naku</span></p><p begin="2:36.120" end="2:38.520" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.120" end="2:36.480">な</span><span begin="2:36.480" end="2:36.780">く</span><span begin="2:36.780" end="2:37.160">し</span><span begin="2:37.160" end="2:37.500">た</span><span begin="2:37.500" end="2:37.820">モ</span><span begin="2:37.820" end="2:38.170">ノ</span><span begin="2:38.170" end="2:38.520">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将已经失去的东西</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nakushita mono o</span></p><p begin="2:38.860" end="2:41.260" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">忘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.860" end="2:39.100">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.100" end="2:39.520">す</span></span></span><span begin="2:39.520" end="2:39.820">れ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">去</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.820" end="2:40.180">さ</span></span></span><span begin="2:40.180" end="2:40.460">る</span><span begin="2:40.460" end="2:40.630">よ</span><span begin="2:40.630" end="2:40.820">う</span><span begin="2:40.820" end="2:41.260">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">彻底忘记吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wasuresaru yō ni</span></p><p begin="2:41.440" end="2:46.520" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">過</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:41.440" end="2:41.840">す</span></span></span><span begin="2:41.840" end="2:42.170">ぎ</span><span begin="2:42.170" end="2:42.360">ゆ</span><span begin="2:42.360" end="2:42.760">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">四</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.760" end="2:43.120">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">季</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:43.120" end="2:43.520">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:43.520" end="2:43.960">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">移</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.160" end="2:44.460">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.460" end="2:44.840">つ</span></span></span><span begin="2:44.840" end="2:45.440">ろ</span><span begin="2:45.440" end="2:46.200">い</span><span begin="2:46.200" end="2:46.520">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在流逝的四季更迭间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sugiyuku shiki no utsuroi ni</span></p><p begin="2:46.800" end="2:51.840" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.800" end="2:47.100">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:47.100" end="2:47.520">ち</span></span></span><span begin="2:47.520" end="2:48.100">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">端</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.100" end="2:48.480">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.480" end="2:48.880">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">揺</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.880" end="2:49.734">ゆ</span></span></span><span begin="2:49.734" end="2:50.180">ら</span><span begin="2:50.180" end="2:50.820">ぐ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">花</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.820" end="2:51.140">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:51.140" end="2:51.500">な</span></span></span><span begin="2:51.500" end="2:51.840">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">路旁摇曳的花儿啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">michi no hashi yuragu hana yo</span></p><p begin="2:52.120" end="2:58.100" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.120" end="2:52.500">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.500" end="2:52.800">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:52.800" end="2:53.460">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:53.820" end="2:54.200">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.200" end="2:54.500">ま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.500" end="2:54.900">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.900" end="2:55.180">に</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.180" end="2:55.481">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.481" end="2:56.160">も</span></span></span><span begin="2:56.160" end="2:58.100">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">此刻你在想着什么呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi wa ima nani omou</span></p><p begin="3:21.480" end="3:26.540" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.480" end="3:21.820">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.820" end="3:22.160">お</span></span></span><span begin="3:22.160" end="3:22.820">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">滲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:23.140" end="3:23.500">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:23.500" end="3:23.800">じ</span></span></span><span begin="3:23.800" end="3:24.160">む</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">縹</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:24.160" end="3:24.520">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:24.520" end="3:24.860">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:24.860" end="3:25.780">だ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:25.780" end="3:26.200">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:26.200" end="3:26.540">ろ</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">流向远方的淡蓝水波中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tōku nijimu hanadairo</span></p><p begin="3:27.100" end="3:31.823" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">流</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.100" end="3:27.560">りゅ</span><span tts:ruby="te