begin="3:36.440" end="3:36.780">て</span><span begin="3:36.780" end="3:37.340">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">羽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:37.800" end="3:38.160">は</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">瀬</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:38.160" end="3:39.200">ぜ</span></span></span><span begin="3:39.200" end="3:39.800">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">惑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:39.800" end="3:40.180">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:40.180" end="3:40.520">ど</span></span></span><span begin="3:40.520" end="3:40.840">い</span><span begin="3:40.840" end="3:42.500">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">凋零的命运仍然不知所措</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chirite mo haze ni madoite</span></p><p begin="3:42.756" end="3:47.820" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:42.756" end="3:43.160">果</span><span begin="3:43.160" end="3:43.500">敢</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:43.500" end="3:43.800">な</span></span></span><span begin="3:43.800" end="3:44.140">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">脆</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:44.140" end="3:44.500">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:44.500" end="3:44.800">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="3:44.800" end="3:45.220">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">砕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:45.460" end="3:45.840">く</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:45.840" end="3:46.160">だ</span></span></span><span begin="3:46.160" end="3:46.480">け</span><span begin="3:46.480" end="3:46.780">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">命</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:46.780" end="3:47.073">つ</span><s