nd="4:08.480">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:08.480" end="4:08.820">め</span></span></span><span begin="4:08.820" end="4:09.160">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将彻夜长谈的梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tomo ni asa made hanashita yume o</span></p><p begin="4:09.480" end="4:14.520" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">紙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:09.480" end="4:09.840">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:09.840" end="4:10.160">み</span></span></span><span begin="4:10.160" end="4:10.500">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">小</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:10.500" end="4:10.840">こ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">舟</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:10.840" end="4:11.180">ぶ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:11.180" end="4:11.520">ね</span></span></span><span begin="4:11.520" end="4:11.900">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">浮</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:12.140" end="4:12.480">う</span></span></span><span begin="4:12.480" end="4:12.820">か</span><span begin="4:12.820" end="4:13.460">べ</span><span begin="4:13.460" end="4:13.920">よ</span><span begin="4:13.920" end="4:14.520">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">放入小小的纸船随之漂浮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kami no kobune ni ukabeyō</span></p><p begin="4:14.780" end="4:19.820" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">長</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:14.780" end="4:15.180">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:15.180" end="4:15.500">が</span></span></span><span begin="4:15.500" end="4:16.020">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">続</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:16.020" end="4:16.440">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:16.440" end="4:16.840">づ</span></span></span><span begin="4:16.840" end="4:17.420">く</span><span begin="4:17.820" end="4:18.200">こ</span><span begin="4:18.200" end="4:18.480">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">旅</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:18.480" end="4:18.860">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:18.860" end="4:19.100">び</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">路</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:19.100" end="4:19.520">じ</span></span></span><span begin="4:19.520" end="4:19.820">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">为这连续不断的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nagaku tsuzuku kono tabiji o</span></p><p begin="4:20.053" end="4:26.020" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">静</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:20.053" end="4:20.413">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:20.413" end="4:20.840">ず</span></span></span><span begin="4:20.840" end="4:21.460">か</span><span begin="4:21.820" end="4:22.160">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:22.160" end="4:22.500">み</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">送っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:22.500" end="4:22.840">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:22.840" end="4:23.120">く</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:23.120" end="4:23.500">っ</span></span></span><span begin="4:23.500" end="4:26.020">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">长长的旅途静静送行吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shizuka ni miokutte</span></p><p begin="5:16.160" end="5:21.140" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:16.160" end="5:16.520">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:16.520" end="5:16.840">み</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">在</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:16.840" end="5:17.160">あ</span></span></span><span begin="5:17.160" end="5:17.460">り</span><span begin="5:17.460" end="5:17.800">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:17.800" end="5:18.200">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="5:18.200" end="5:18.560">の</span><span begin="5:18.820" end="5:19.160">あ</span><span begin="5:19.160" end="5:19.500">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">彩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:19.500" end="5:19.820">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:19.820" end="5:20.160">ろ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:20.160" end="5:20.460">ど</span></span></span><span begin="5:20.460" end="5:20.800">り</span><span begin="5:20.800" end="5:21.140">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">有你在的往昔的光彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi arishi hi no ano irodori yo</span></p><p begin="5:21.480" end="5:26.560" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:21.480" end="5:21.760">何</span><span begin="5:21.760" end="5:22.140">時</span><span begin="5:22.140" end="5:22.480">か</span><span begin="5:22.480" end="5:22.780">ま</span><span begin="5:22.780" end="5:23.120">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">音</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:23.120" end="5:23.400">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:23.400" end="5:24.100">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">連</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:24.100" end="5:24.440">づ</span></span></span><span begin="5:24.440" end="5:24.820">れ</span><span begin="5:24.820" end="5:25.220">る</span><span begin="5:25.400" end="5:25.840">よ</span><span begin="5:25.840" end="5:26.120">う</span><span begin="5:26.120" end="5:26.560">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">总有一天会再次带来美妙之声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsuka mata otozureru yō ni</span></p><p begin="5:26.760" end="5:31.900" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:26.760" end="5:27.040">ぽ</span><span begin="5:27.040" end="5:27.480">つ</span><span begin="5:27.480" end="5:27.880">り</span><span begin="5:28.100" end="5:28.380">ぽ</span><span begin="5:28.380" end="5:28.820">つ</span><span begin="5:28.820" end="5:29.160">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">紡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:29.380" end="5:29.840">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:29.840" end="5:30.160">む</span></span></span><span begin="5:30.160" end="5:30.460">ぐ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">音</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:30.460" end="5:30.800">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:30.800" end="5:31.120">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">霊</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:31.120" end="5:31.500">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:31.500" end="5:31.900">ま</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">断断续续的交织的音灵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">potsuri potsuri tsumugu otodama</span></p><p begin="5:32.391" end="5:37.060" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:32.391" end="5:32.800">よ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:32.800" end="5:33.780">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:33.780" end="5:34.440">ぜ</span></span></span><span begin="5:34.440" end="5:34.780">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">乗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:34.780" end="5:35.080">の</span></span></span><span begin="5:35.080" end="5:35.480">せ</span><span begin="5:35.480" end="5:37.060">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">乘上夜风</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yokaze ni nosete</span></p><p begin="5:37.400" end="5:39.940" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">去</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:37.400" end="5:37.860">さ</span></span></span><span begin="5:37.860" end="5:38.220">り</span><span begin="5:38.220" end="5:38.520">ゆ</span><span begin="5:38.520" end="5:38.840">く</span><span begin="5:38.840" end="5:39.180">モ</span><span begin="5:39.180" end="5:39.500">ノ</span><span begin="5:39.500" end="5:39.940">へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">向着已经离去的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sariyuku mono e</span></p><p begin="5:40.120" end="5:42.480" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">捧</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:40.120" end="5:40.400">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:40.400" end="5:40.860">さ</span></span></span><span begin="5:40.860" end="5:41.140">ぐ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:41.140" end="5:41.500">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:41.500" end="5:41.800">も</span></span></span><span begin="5:41.800" end="5:42.160">い</span><span begin="5:42.160" end="5:42.480">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">献上思念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sasagu omoi no</span></p><p begin="5:42.760" end="5:47.840" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:42.760" end="5:43.140">そ</span><span begin="5:43.140" end="5:43.480">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">儚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:43.480" end="5:43.780">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:43.780" end="5:44.140">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:44.140" end="5:44.440">な</span></span></span><span begin="5:44.440" end="5:44.820">さ</span><span begin="5:44.820" end="5:45.440">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">止</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:45.440" end="5:45.780">と</span></span></span><span begin="5:45.780" end="5:46.140">め</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">処</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:46.140" end="5:46.520">ど</span></span></span><span begin="5:46.780" end="5:47.500">な</span><span begin="5:47.500" end="5:47.840">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">让这梦幻永不终结</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono hakanasa ni tomedonaku</span></p><p begin="5:48.160" end="5:53.100" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">瞼</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:48.160" end="5:48.340">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:48.340" end="5:48.840">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:48.840" end="5:49.420">ぶ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:49.420" end="5:49.760">た</span></span></span><span begin="5:49.760" end="5:50.160">か</span><span begin="5:50.160" end="5:50.720">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">落</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:51.120" end="5:51.400">お</span></span></span><span begin="5:51.400" end="5:51.820">つ</span><span begin="5:51.820" end="5:52.140">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">玉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:52.140" end="5:52.480">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:52.480" end="5:52.800">ま</span></span></span><span begin="5:52.800" end="5:53.100">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">眼中滚落的泪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">manabuta kara otsuru tama wa</span></p><p begin="5:53.460" end="5:59.700" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:53.460" end="5:53.800">何</span><span begin="5:53.800" end="5:54.100">故</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">杯</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:54.100" end="5:55.122">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:55.122" end="5:55.480">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:55.480" end="5:55.800">ず</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:55.800" end="5:56.160">き</span></span></span><span begin="5:56.160" end="5:56.500">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">染</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:56.500" end="5:56.800">そ</span></span></span><span begin="5:56.800" end="5:59.700">む</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">为何浸染了杯子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">naze sakazuki o somu</span></p></div></body></tt>